omance really means at  that age they said it can never be a  simple and stable relationship but that  there is fun to that instability max and  Lucas were such good friends in the last  season we hope that even if they break  up in season 3 they are able to remain  good friends but what do you guys think  are Lucas and Max better as friends or  boyfriends and girlfriends let us know  in the comments Steve and Robin the  season 3 trailer also highlighted the  promise of new friendships in addition  to the old ones from what we can gather  Steve got a new job at the new shopping  mall working at an ice cream shop those  sailor uniforms are the most adorable  things we've ever seen  anyway in the trailer Steve and Dustin  are doing their supercool secret  handshake in front of a new character  and this character is actually Steve's  age from her nametag we can see that her  name is Robin and she is all about  keeping it real  she watches with the confused look on  her face as Steve has an immature  lightsaber fight with Dustin then at the  end of the trailer she asks a pretty  important question how many children are  you friends with she asks how many  children Steve is friends with she's got  a point Steve needs to invest in a few  relationships with people his own age as  well as the kids and Robin appears to be  the perfect candidate as Steve's new  friend maybe Robin can save Steve from  whoever or whatever injected him in the  neck and the latest trailer that was  super disturbing anywho here's to  Steve's newest friendship the whole gang  if you were lucky enough to have a group  of friends like the ones and stranger  things hold on to them tight in the  season 3 trailer we see Dustin returning  from camp his melancholy loneliness is  scored beautifully by Motley Crue's home  sweet home dejected Dustin is sad that  no one is there to greet him he comments  that at least his turtle is happy he's  home suddenly all of his toys come to  life and roll out of his bedroom  Dustin is clearly freaked out so he  grabs a can of hairspray and follows the  toys to the living room we see that the  gang is hiding ready to surprise him  with a welcome home party and that 11 is  the one making the toys move it was the  sweetest thing ever when they all jumped  out to surprise Dustin unfortunately for  Lucas Dustin totally panicked he let out  a massive scream and spray Lucas right  in the face with the hairspray though  that's gotta hurt but before that we got  to see that the bond between Dustin Max  Lucas will Mike and 11 is stronger than  ever  they've been through so much together  it's great to see them having some fun  too and after seeing season three's new  and terrifying monster the gangs going  to need to band together more than ever  before what's your favorite friendship  and stranger things  leave your top pick in the comments  thanks for watching the things if you're  excited to watch season 3 of stranger  things be sure to subscribe to our  channel and like this video see you next  time  [Music]

